It's never 100% avoidable, but you can reduce the chances considerably
by increasing how fast you explore compared to how fast you level up
towards the start of the game, and explicitly aiming to improve your
equipment as a higher priority than improving your stats. This causes
the game to keep the monster difficulty down further than it would
otherwise.

